{"parse": {"title": "Tarnished halberd", "pageid": 667179, "revid": 15290742, "redirects": [], "wikitext": {"*": "{{Infobox Item\n|name = Tarnished halberd\n|image = [[File:Tarnished halberd.png]]\n|release = [[30 June]] [[2026]]\n|update = The Blood Moon Rises - Out Today!\n|members = Yes\n|quest = No\n|tradeable = No\n|placeholder = Yes\n|equipable = No\n|stackable = No\n|noteable = No\n|options = Polish, Drop\n|examine = A tarnished halberd, not fit for a lord.\n|value = 60000\n|weight = 1.814\n|id = 33685\n}}\n[[File:Tarnished halberd detail.png|130px|left]]\nA '''tarnished halberd''' is a [[Tarnished|tarnished item]] dropped by [[venator]]s and the [[Maggot King]]. It can be polished to reveal a random [[halberd]], granting between 200 and 250 [[Crafting]] XP.\n\nPolishing the halberd will display the message {{Mes|You rub the tarnished halberd on your clothes and are surprised to find a shine underneath the grime.}}\n\n==Rewards==\n{{Skill info\n|skill1name = Crafting\n|skill1lvl = 64\n|skill1boostable =\n|skill1exp = 200-250\n}}\n\n{{DropLogProject|kills=2687}}\n\n{{Average drop value|mob=Tarnished halberd|mobname=tarnished halberd|killname=polish}}\n\n{{Average drop value|mob=Tarnished halberd|mobname=tarnished halberd|killname=polish|alch=yes}}\n\n{{DropsTableHead}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|skill=crafting|name=Rune halberd|quantity=1|rarity=5/10}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|skill=crafting|name=Adamant halberd|quantity=1|rarity=4/10}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|skill=crafting|name=Dragon halberd|quantity=1|rarity=1/10}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n==Item sources==\n{{Drop sources}}\n\n==Changes==\n{{Subject changes header}}\n{{Subject changes\n|date = 5 August 2026\n|update = Wyrmscraig & Sailing Changes\n|change = The tarnished halberd no longer has a \"Wield\" option. Previously, selecting the option resulted in a game message stating {{mes|You can't wear this item.}}\n}}\n{{Subject changes\n|date = 15 July 2026\n|update = The Blood Moon Rises & Bank Tags Tweaks\n|change =\n* The item's [[value]] was increased from 500 to 60,000.\n* Tarnished items now take 1 tick to polish, down from 3 ticks.\n}}\n{{Subject changes footer}}\n\n==Trivia==\n* The examine text is a reference to ''{{wp|Elden Ring}}'', a video game in which the player character, a \"Tarnished\" (exile), seeks to become the \"Elden Lord\". Throughout their journey, the Tarnished encounters foes who deem them unworthy or incapable of attaining the lordship &ndash; \"not fit for a lord.\""}}, "fetchedAt": "2026-10-06T04:22:21.344478+00:00", "dropHtml": "<table class=\"wikitable sortable filterable item-drops autosort=4,a\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"border-right: none;\" class=\"drops-img-header drop-disp-btn unsortable\" title=\"Sort items by category, rarity and name.\"></th>\n<th style=\"border-left: none;\" class=\"item-col\">Item</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">Quantity</th>\n<th>Rarity</th>\n<th class=\"ge-column\" data-sort-type=\"number\">Price</th>\n<th class=\"alch-column\" data-sort-type=\"number\">High Alch</th>\n</tr>\n\n<tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td class=\"inventory-image\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Rune_halberd\" title=\"Rune halberd\"><img alt=\"Rune halberd.png: Tarnished halberd drops Rune halberd with rarity 5/10 in quantity 1\" src=\"/images/Rune_halberd.png?11c4e\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"27\" height=\"29\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"27\" data-file-height=\"29\" /></a></span></td><td class=\"item-col\" style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"/w/Rune_halberd\" title=\"Rune halberd\">Rune halberd</a></td><td data-sort-value=\"1\">1</td><td data-sort-value=\"2\" class=\"table-bg-green\" title=\"50%\"><span data-drop-percent=\"50\" data-drop-permil=\"500\" data-drop-fraction=\"5/10\" data-drop-permyriad=\"5000\" data-drop-oneover=\"1/2\">5/10</span></td><td data-sort-value=\"37727\" class=\"ge-column\" title=\"37,727 coins\" style=\"text-align:right;cursor:hel